title_en:
If you ship a public-facing AI agent, you have to assume people will try to abuse it. Just a fact of life.

@danicat83 outlined some truly useful ways to limit the risk. Constrain turns and token usage per session, apply least privilege, and more.
https://danicat.dev/posts/chibi-dani-architecture/

title_zh:
